# --- Local development (recommended) ---
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset: the app uses same-origin `/api` and Vite proxies to the .NET API.
# Proxy target (HTTPS dev cert ok with secure: false):
#   VITE_DEV_API_PROXY_TARGET=https://localhost:5001
# If your API is HTTP-only on port 5000:
#   VITE_DEV_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:5000
#
# --- Override direct API URL (optional) ---
# Only set if you skip the proxy — must match real scheme/port:
#   https://localhost:5001/api   (HTTPS on 5001)
#   http://localhost:5000/api    (HTTP on 5000)
# Wrong: http://localhost:5001/api → ERR_EMPTY_RESPONSE (TLS port).
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
